["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">円</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>圆形；日元；圆（形状）；圆滑；圆润</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まる.い・まる・まど・まど.か・まろ.やか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">円</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">日元；圆；圆形</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">円周</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんしゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">圆周</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">楕円</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だえん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">椭圆；椭圆形</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">子</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>孩子；鼠（十二生肖第一位）；子时（晚上11点至凌晨1点）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ・ス・ツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こ・-こ・ね</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">子供</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こども</span><span class=\"k-wz\">孩子；儿童</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">帽子</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼうし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">帽子；帽；（围棋）镇；戴帽</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お菓子</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おかし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">糖果；糕点；甜食；零食</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">外</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>外面；其他；脱离；偏离；外</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み