=\"ja\">てんきよほう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">天气预报；气象预报</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">天候</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">天气；天候</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">母</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>母亲</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はは・も</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お母さん</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おかあさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">母亲；妈妈；妈；母亲大人；妻子；老婆；您（对年长于说话者的老年人的称呼）；她</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">伯母さん</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おばさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">姑妈；姨妈；婶婶；舅妈；伯母（对父母的姐妹或叔伯舅之妻的亲切称呼）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">祖母</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そぼ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">祖母；外婆；奶奶</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">右</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>右</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ウ・ユウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みぎ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">右</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">右；右侧；右边；右手；（竖写文中）上文；上述；右翼；右派；（两者中）较优者</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">左右</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さゆう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">左右；左边和右边；控制；影响；支配；侍从；随从；（侍奉于某人的）身边；侧近；含糊其辞；模棱两可</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">読</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>阅读</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドク・トク・トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よ.む・-よ.み</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">読む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">读</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">読書</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どくしょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">读书</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">読み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">阅读；诵读；读音；训读；解读；理解；判断；推断；预测</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">友</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>朋友</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ユウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とも</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">友達</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ともだち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">朋友</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">友</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とも</span><span class=\"k-wz\">朋友；伙伴；同伴；（书籍等）相伴之物；良伴；补充；附属品</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">親友</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんゆう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">知心朋友；密友；挚友</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">左</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>左</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サ・シャ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひだり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">左</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひだり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">左；左侧；左方；左手；左翼；左派；嗜酒；好酒之人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">左右</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さゆう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">左右；左边和右边；控制；影响；支配；侍从；随从；（侍奉于某人的）身边；侧近；含糊其辞；模棱两可</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">左利き</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひだりきき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">左撇子；左手人；左利的人；嗜酒；好酒者；饮酒爱好者</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">休</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>休息；休假；退休；睡觉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やす.む・やす.まる・やす.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">休み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やすみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">休息；休憩；喘息；假期；假日；缺席；暂停；（蚕在蜕皮前的）休眠状态</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">休む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やすむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缺席；请假；休息；小憩；就寝；睡觉；上床休息；暂时停止；停业</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">夏休み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なつやすみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">暑假；暑期</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">父</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>父亲</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ちち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お父さん</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おとうさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">父亲；爸爸；爹爹；老爸；丈夫；您；你；他（对年长者的称呼）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お祖父さん</span>